      "guid": "com.mugnum.expandedfpslimit",
      "name": "Expanded FPS Limit",
      "slug": "expanded-fps-limit",
      "teaser": "Increases maximum FPS limit.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2750.png",
      "downloads": 13929,
      "favourites_count": 14,
      "description": "<p>Increases maximum FPS limit from 144 (game) and 60 (lobby) up to 360 FPS.</p>\n<p>Particularly useful if you can’t stomach the 60 FPS lock in menus.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/preview.png\" alt=\"preview.png\" /></p>\n<p>The 360 FPS value can be increased further via config (F12 menu).</p>\n<p>Background FPS limit can be specified via config, which limits FPS when game is minimized (disabled by default).</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/example_lobby.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lobby example.</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mugnum/SPT_ExpandedFpsLimit/refs/heads/master/Media/example_game.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">In-game example.</a></p>\n",
